Homepage: https://github.com/burn-lab-dev/cantcp
Description: cantcp command-line client
 cantcp-cli connects to cantcp servers: it listens to CAN frames, sends
 frames built from flags or read from candump-style files, and fetches the
 server statistics over HTTP. Connections can use TLS 1.3 with an optional
 client certificate.
 .
 Developed by BURN-LAB: https://burn-lab.ru
